<title>UK: De La Rue H1 profit at top of estimates.</title>
<headline>De La Rue H1 profit at top of estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.7		   vs 23.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.5		    vs 7.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     60.3		   vs 69.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   381.9		  vs 347.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits ranged from 55.0 to 61.0 million stg.</p>
</text>
